s\">native_os</a> == .windows) <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/#std.os\">os</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/windows/#std.os.windows\">windows</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/windows/#std.os.windows.HANDLE\">HANDLE</a> <span class=\"tok-kw\">else</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>stdin: ?<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/File/#std.Io.File\">File</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>子进程标准输入管道的写入端。\n使用时要求设置 <code>process.SpawnOptions.StdIo.pipe</code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>stdout: ?<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/File/#std.Io.File\">File</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>子进程标准输出管道的读取端。\n使用时要求 <code>process.SpawnOptions.StdIo.pipe</code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>stderr: ?<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/File/#std.Io.File\">File</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>子进程标准错误管道的读取端。\n使用此字段要求设置 <code>process.SpawnOptions.StdIo.pipe</code>。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>resource_usage_statistics: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics\">ResourceUsageStatistics</a> = .{}</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>如果在调用 <code>spawn</code> 之前将\n<code>request_resource_usage_statistics</code> 设置为 <code>true</code>，\n则调用 wait 后可获取此数据。\nTODO 将此数据移入 <code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Term\">Term</a></code></p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>request_resource_usage_statistics: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child\"><code>Child</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.builtin\"><code>builtin</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.native_os\"><code>native_os</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\"><code>Io</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/#std.process\"><code>process</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/File/#std.Io.File\"><code>File</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug.assert\"><code>assert</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\"><code>Allocator</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Id\"><code>Id</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics\"><code>ResourceUsageStatistics</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Term\"><code>Term</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Cwd\"><code>Cwd</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.kill\"><code>kill</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.WaitError\"><code>WaitError</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.wait\"><code>wait</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Allocator\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Allocator</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L11\">源码行 11</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/mem/Allocator/#std.mem.Allocator\"><code>std.mem.Allocator</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.assert\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.assert</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L10\">源码行 10</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug.assert\"><code>std.debug.assert</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.builtin\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.builtin</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L3\">源码行 3</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Child\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Child</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">源码行 1</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child\"><code>std.process.Child</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Cwd\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Cwd</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L117\">源码行 117</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>inherit</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>子进程的当前工作目录与当前进程相同。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>dir: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/Dir/#std.Io.Dir\">Dir</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>POSIX 系统上，在 <code>fork</code> 之后使用此句柄调用 <code>fchdir</code>。\nWindows 上，从提供的句柄推导路径，并在调用 <code>CreateProcessW</code> 时使用该路径。</p>\n</div>\n<pre><code>path: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>在 POSIX 系统上，<code>fork</code> 后使用此路径调用 <code>chdir</code>。\n在 Windows 上，调用 <code>CreateProcessW</code> 时使用此路径。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.File\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.File</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L9\">源码行 9</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/File/#std.Io.File\"><code>std.Io.File</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Id\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Id</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">类型</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L13\">源码行 13</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Io\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Io</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L7\">源码行 7</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\"><code>std.Io</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.kill\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.kill</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L134\">源码行 134</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>请求操作系统强制终止子进程，\n然后阻塞至其终止，再清理全部资源。</p>\n<p>幂等；<code><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.wait\">wait</a></code> 返回后不执行任何操作。</p>\n<p>不可取消。忽略操作系统的意外错误。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">kill</span>(child: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child\">Child</a>, io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>child: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child\">Child</a></code></pre>\n<pre><code>io: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Io/#std.Io\">Io</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.native_os\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.native_os</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L4\">源码行 4</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.process\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.process</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L8\">源码行 8</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/#std.process\"><code>std.process</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L40\">源码行 40</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>rusage: <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.rusage_init\">rusage_init</a>) = <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.rusage_init\">rusage_init</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.getMaxRss\"><code>getMaxRss</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.rusage_init\"><code>rusage_init</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.getMaxRss\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.getMaxRss</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L45\">源码行 45</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>若可用，则返回子进程的峰值常驻集大小，单位为字节。</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">getMaxRss</span>(rus: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics\">ResourceUsageStatistics</a>) ?<span class=\"tok-type\">usize</span></code></pre>\n<h4>参数</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>rus: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics\">ResourceUsageStatistics</a></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.rusage_init\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.ResourceUsageStatistics.rusage_init</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L73\">源码行 73</a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.std\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L6\">源码行 6</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Term\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Term</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L94\">源码行 94</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>exited: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>signal: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/posix/#std.posix\">posix</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/posix/#std.posix.SIG\">SIG</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>stopped: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/posix/#std.posix\">posix</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/posix/#std.posix.SIG\">SIG</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>unknown: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Term.success\"><code>success</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Term.format\"><code>format</code></a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.process.Child.Term.format\"><h3><code>std.process.Child.Term.format</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">函数</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L107\">源码行 107</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">format</span>(t: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/process/Child/#std.process.Child.Term\">Term</a>, w: *<a href=\"/zig-